Description: Remote control for LG NetCast televisions
 LG Лентяйка — a desktop application that turns a Linux computer
 into a full-featured remote control for LG televisions supporting
 the NetCast protocol (mostly 2010-2014 models).
 .
 Features include power control, volume and channel rockers with
 auto-repeat, D-Pad navigation, numeric keypad, source selection,
 and quick access to TV info and settings.
 .
 The application works entirely over the local network, requires
 no account, and does not collect or transmit any personal data.